## ansible-playbook ##

ansible playbook is a YAML file that defines a set of task ansible should execute 
on remote server.

  ---
- name: Configure Web Servers
  hosts: all
  become: true

  tasks:

    - name: Update package manager
      ansible.builtin.apt:
        update_cache: true
      when: ansible_os_family == "Debian"

    - name: Install nginx
      ansible.builtin.package:
        name: nginx
        state: present

    - name: Start nginx
      ansible.builtin.service:
        name: nginx
        state: started
        enabled: true


to run this :- ansible-playbook -i file-name.yaml 










